# Line-ending policy.
#
# This tree is edited from both native Windows and WSL. Without a policy, a
# Windows-side save rewrites a whole file as CRLF: on 2026-08-24 six untouched
# files (_fast_search.pyx, three generated .c files, replay.py, setup_cython.py)
# showed 56,677 insertions against 56,677 deletions with no source change,
# which masks real diffs and triggers a spurious Cython rebuild because the
# .pyx mtime moves. Shell scripts must be LF to run under WSL at all.
#
# text=auto lets git detect binaries; eol=lf normalizes every text file to LF
# in the index and in the working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these, whatever the content sniffer decides.
*.pt   binary
*.pth  binary
*.onnx binary
*.so   binary
*.pyd  binary
*.zip  binary
*.gz   binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
